Well, from our perspective it kinda is one game: each game of NetHack is a
single scoreboard entry, an the trophy rules function on the collection of all
score entries.

Like I said above, we're not trying to make the names match _exactly_ the
terms' meaning, just to get the number of requirements to match the number
referenced in the term.  Thus, the Hat Trick (which references 3) is a trophy
with 3 requirements.

So it's not a perfect match, certainly, but Hat Trick is at least close than
Double Top.  ;-)

